@startuml
left to right direction
actor Customer
actor "Retail Customer" as Retail
actor "Business Customer" as Business
Retail --|> Customer
Business --|> Customer
rectangle "Bank Transaction API" {
 usecase "Do Transfer" as Transfer
 usecase "Buy Airtime" as Airtime
 usecase "View Transaction History" as History
 usecase "Apply Discount" as Discount
 usecase "Record Audit" as Audit
}
Customer --> Transfer
Customer --> Airtime
Customer --> History
Transfer .> Discount : <<include>>
Transfer .> Audit : <<include>>
Airtime .> Audit : <<include>>
History .> Audit : <<include>>
note right of Discount : Internal system behaviour;
not a direct customer action.
@enduml
